		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4051&amp;p=31224#p31224"><![CDATA[
A new Beta version is available<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/Firmware/Latest" class="postlink">downloads/GD77/Firmware/Latest</a><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/Firmware/6e0f57bb10ad867bfefe6411236ff66def577cfe" class="postlink">downloads/GD77/Firmware/6e0f57bb10ad867 ... 6def577cfe</a><br><br>This version has the following changes<br><br>* Fixes problem with satellite APRS frequencies<br>* Adds Safe Boot mode (SK1 + 0) to be used when the radio will not bootup or bootloops.<br>* Updates translations<br>* Fixes scan frequencies range boundary display problem<br>* Fixes voice prompt problem when replaying a prompt<br>* Fixes possible hanging problems associated with I2Cinternal bus contention<br><br>All these changes were made by Daniel F1RMB, so thanks goes to him and the varoius translators and people who have reported bugs and helped Daniel test his fixes<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat May 11, 2024 6:35 am</p><hr />
